QEMU has been accepted into Google Summer of Code 2018 again.  Here is
our list of project ideas:
https://wiki.qemu.org/Google_Summer_of_Code_2018

Google Summer of Code is an open source internship program that offers
12-week full-time remote work during the summer for eligible
university students.  You can learn more here:
https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/

We have a great team of mentors from the QEMU, KVM, and Jailhouse
communities who look forward to working with interns this support to
produce excellent open source software!  If you are enrolled at a
university, be sure to check out this internship program.

